---
// Unlisted pitch deck for Request for Founders, thesis 4. Not linked from the site, noindex.
const total = 13;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
    <title>Runs Without You · Bunyasit Fang</title>
    <meta name="description" content="An AI back office that does the admin for Southeast Asian small businesses." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="progress" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>

    <main id="deck">
      <!-- 1 -->
      <section class="slide dark hero">
        <p class="kicker">Request for Founders · Thesis 04</p>
        <h1>Runs Without You.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">An AI back office that does the admin for Southeast Asian small businesses. Not another dashboard.</p>
        <p class="byline">Bunyasit Fang</p>
      </section>

      <!-- 2 -->
      <section class="slide">
        <p class="kicker">The problem</p>
        <h2>Every owner works a second job. <span class="dim">Unpaid, after closing.</span></h2>
        <div class="grid g4">
          <div class="tile"><span class="num">01</span><h3>Buying and selling</h3><p>Orders land in LINE and Shopee. Slips, invoices and stock get reconciled by hand at night.</p></div>
          <div class="tile"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Suppliers</h3><p>Finding them, comparing them, negotiating in two languages over weeks of email.</p></div>
          <div class="tile"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Imports and legal</h3><p>Customs, FDA and tax documents checked by the one person who knows where everything is.</p></div>
          <div class="tile"><span class="num">04</span><h3>Freelancers</h3><p>Found, briefed, chased and paid one chat thread at a time.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 3 -->
      <section class="slide">
        <p class="kicker">Why I see it</p>
        <h2>I'm not studying this problem. <span class="dim">I own it.</span></h2>
        <div class="grid g3">
          <div class="stat"><b>51%</b><p>Owner of Onecha, a matcha import and resale business. Every job on the last slide is my job.</p></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>JOJO Soba</b><p>Founded and ran a coffee and soba cafe in Bangkok. I did the books after closing.</p></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>Portfolio</b><p>My family backs friends' businesses. I sit inside their operations and see the same bottlenecks repeat.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 4 -->
      <section class="slide">
        <p class="kicker">The insight</p>
        <h2>Owners don't need dashboards. <span class="dim">They need hands.</span></h2>
        <div class="grid g2 compare">
          <div class="panel">
            <p class="label">Software today</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Owner types the data in</li>
              <li>Software draws it as a chart</li>
              <li>Owner still does the work</li>
              <li>Abandoned by week two</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="panel on">
            <p class="label">Runs Without You</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Reads what already exists: chats, slips, email, bank alerts</li>
              <li>Does the work: books, orders, checks, briefs</li>
              <li>Owner approves with one tap</li>
              <li>Admin goes from hours to minutes</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 5 -->
      <section class="slide">
        <p class="kicker">The product, on day one</p>
        <h2>One matcha order. <span class="dim">End to end, at Onecha.</span></h2>
        <ol class="flow">
          <li><span class="mono">Source</span><p>Shortlists Japanese suppliers by grade and price. Drafts the first email in Japanese.</p></li>
          <li><span class="mono">Buy</span><p>Summarises the negotiation, drafts the PO, schedules payment.</p></li>
          <li><span class="mono">Import</span><p>Checks customs and FDA documents against the PO before it ships.</p></li>
          <li><span class="mono">Sell</span><p>Turns LINE and Shopee orders into invoices and stock movements.</p></li>
          <li><span class="mono">Staff</span><p>Briefs, tracks and pays freelancers from one queue.</p></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="note">I control Onecha, so it ships on day one with no sales cycle, and every hour saved is measured on a real business.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- 6 -->
      <section class="slide">
        <p class="kicker">How it works</p>
        <div class="split">
          <div>
            <h2>Nothing moves <span class="dim">without a tap.</span></h2>
            <dl class="steps">
              <div><dt>Ingest</dt><dd>Reads LINE, email, bank alerts, Shopee and the POS, in Thai, Japanese and English.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Decide</dt><dd>Proposes the next action with its evidence attached.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Approve</dt><dd>The owner taps yes. Autonomy grows task by task as trust is earned.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
          <div class="phone" aria-label="Example approval message in LINE">
            <div class="chat-head"><span class="dot"></span>Runs Without You</div>
            <div class="bubble">
              <p class="b-title">Reorder ceremonial matcha?</p>
              <p>Stock runs out in about 9 days at the current sales pace. Best quote is from your Uji supplier, 20 kg, landed in 12 days.</p>
              <div class="evidence">
                <span>3 sales exports</span><span>Supplier quote</span><span>Stock count</span>
              </div>
              <div class="actions"><button tabindex="-1">Edit</button><button tabindex="-1" class="yes">Approve</button></div>
            </div>
            <p class="caption">Illustrative message</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 7 -->
      <section class="slide">
        <p class="kicker">Why now</p>
        <h2>The work was never hard. <span class="dim">Reading it was.</span></h2>
        <div class="grid g3">
          <div class="tile"><h3>Models can read the mess</h3><p>Thai slips, Japanese supplier mail and customs forms are now readable by machine, reliably.</p></div>
          <div class="tile"><h3>The records are already digital</h3><p>PromptPay, e-tax invoices and marketplace exports mean nobody has to type anything in.</p></div>
          <div class="tile"><h3>Owners already live in LINE</h3><p>No new app to adopt. The engine works inside the chat the business already runs on.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 8 -->
      <section class="slide">
        <p class="kicker">What it encodes</p>
        <h2>Well-run businesses have the same habits. <span class="dim">Most owners can't keep them up alone.</span></h2>
        <div class="grid g2 habits">
          <div class="habit"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"></span><p><b>Reorder before the stock-out,</b> not after.</p></div>
          <div class="habit"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"></span><p><b>Reconcile every slip the same day,</b> not at month end.</p></div>
          <div class="habit"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"></span><p><b>Check documents before the shipment leaves,</b> not at customs.</p></div>
          <div class="habit"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"></span><p><b>Brief people in writing,</b> not in a voice note at midnight.</p></div>
        </div>
        <p class="note">The engine runs these habits by default, so every owner gets them without the discipline.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- 9 -->
      <section class="slide">
        <p class="kicker">How I de-risk</p>
        <h2>Theory first, then evidence. <span class="dim">With a tool I built.</span></h2>
        <p class="lede">RocketMap is my AI business model canvas. It turns a venture into ranked hypotheses and pairs each with the cheapest test that could kill it. These are the three that matter here, and the test for each.</p>
        <div class="grid g3">
          <div class="tile"><span class="mono">Desirability</span><h3>Owners will hand admin to an agent if every action shows its evidence.</h3><p class="test">Test: approval rate on real Onecha actions.</p></div>
          <div class="tile"><span class="mono">Feasibility</span><h3>Models read Thai slips, Japanese mail and customs forms accurately enough.</h3><p class="test">Test: accuracy on Onecha's own records.</p></div>
          <div class="tile"><span class="mono">Viability</span><h3>Owners pay more than a bookkeeper hour a week to get daily hours back.</h3><p class="test">Test: paid conversion in the portfolio pilots.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 10 -->
      <section class="slide">
        <p class="kicker">Founder</p>
        <h2>Operator. AI builder. <span class="dim">Shipper.</span></h2>
        <div class="grid g3">
          <div class="tile"><h3>Operator</h3><p>Majority owner of Onecha. Founded JOJO Soba. Inside the operations of my family's portfolio.</p></div>
          <div class="tile"><h3>AI builder</h3><p>PassionSeed reached 300 users in a month. Built RocketMap, CareerAc, NeuralMix, and Hive, a Gemini hackathon semi-finalist.</p></div>
          <div class="tile"><h3>Shipper</h3><p>LongKeeb sold mechanical keyboards to paying customers worldwide. I ran sourcing, manufacturing and fulfilment myself.</p></div>
        </div>
        <p class="note">Chulalongkorn, Integrated Innovation · UC Berkeley SCET Startup Semester · 30+ shipped projects</p>
      </section>

      <!-- 11 -->
      <section class="slide">
        <p class="kicker">Business</p>
        <h2>Cheaper than a bookkeeper. <span class="dim">Does more than one.</span></h2>
        <div class="grid g3">
          <div class="stat"><b>฿1,990</b><p>Target price per business per month. Less than one bookkeeper hour a week.</p></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>~3M</b><p>Small and medium businesses in Thailand, most with fewer than ten staff.</p></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>SEA</b><p>Next markets share the same LINE and QR payment habits: Vietnam, Indonesia, the Philippines.</p></div>
        </div>
        <p class="note">Wedge: import and resale traders and small food businesses in Bangkok. Later, a take rate on payments and supplier orders that run through the engine.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- 12 -->
      <section class="slide">
        <p class="kicker">The next twelve weeks</p>
        <h2>From one business <span class="dim">to paying customers.</span></h2>
        <ol class="timeline">
          <li><span class="mono">Weeks 1–4</span><h3>Onecha live</h3><p>Ingest LINE, email and slips. Sourcing and purchase orders run on real orders. Feasibility test done.</p></li>
          <li><span class="mono">Weeks 5–8</span><h3>Portfolio pilots</h3><p>Five businesses from the family portfolio. Import checks and the freelancer queue ship.</p></li>
          <li><span class="mono">Weeks 9–12</span><h3>Prove it</h3><p>Measure hours saved and errors caught. Convert pilots to paid. Pitch on December 4 with live customers.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <!-- 13 -->
      <section class="slide dark hero">
        <p class="kicker">The ask</p>
        <h1>฿1,000,000</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Twelve months of runway, one engineer, and the LINE, bank and customs integrations.</p>
        <p class="hero-sub dimmer">Goal: fifty paying businesses, each owner spending under five minutes a day on admin.</p>
        <p class="byline"><a href="mailto:bunyasit@passionseed.org">bunyasit@passionseed.org</a> · <a href="https://bigf.me">bigf.me</a> · <a href="https://github.com/xb1g">github.com/xb1g</a></p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <nav id="hud" aria-label="Slide navigation">
      <button id="prev" aria-label="Previous slide"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16"><path d="M15 18l-6-6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
      <span id="count">01 / {String(total).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
      <button id="next" aria-label="Next slide"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16"><path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
    </nav>

    <script is:inline define:vars={{ total }}>
      const deck = document.getElementById('deck');
      const slides = [...deck.querySelectorAll('.slide')];
      const count = document.getElementById('count');
      const bar = document.querySelector('#progress span');
      const hud = document.getElementById('hud');
      const pad = (n) => String(n).padStart(2, '0');
      const current = () => Math.round(deck.scrollLeft / deck.clientWidth);
      const go = (i) => {
        const n = Math.max(0, Math.min(total - 1, i));
        deck.scrollTo({ left: n * deck.clientWidth, behavior: 'smooth' });
      };
      const update = () => {
        const n = current();
        count.textContent = `${pad(n + 1)} / ${pad(total)}`;
        bar.style.transform = `scaleX(${(n + 1) / total})`;
        hud.classList.toggle('on-dark', slides[n].classList.contains('dark'));
        slides.forEach((s, i) => s.classList.toggle('active', i === n));
        history.replaceState(null, '', `#${n + 1}`);
      };
      deck.addEventListener('scroll', update, { passive: true });
      document.getElementById('prev').onclick = () => go(current() - 1);
      document.getElementById('next').onclick = () => go(current() + 1);
      addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
        if (['ArrowRight', 'ArrowDown', 'PageDown', ' '].includes(e.key)) { e.preventDefault(); go(current() + 1); }
        if (['ArrowLeft', 'ArrowUp', 'PageUp'].includes(e.key)) { e.preventDefault(); go(current() - 1); }
        if (e.key === 'Home') go(0);
        if (e.key === 'End') go(total - 1);
      });
      addEventListener('resize', () => deck.scrollTo({ left: current() * deck.clientWidth }));
      const start = parseInt(location.hash.slice(1), 10);
      if (start > 1 && start <= slides.length) deck.scrollTo({ left: (start - 1) * deck.clientWidth });
      requestAnimationFrame(update);
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --bg: #fbfbfd;
    --ink: #1d1d1f;
    --mute: #6e6e73;
    --faint: #86868b;
    --line: #e5e5ea;
    --tile: #ffffff;
    --accent: #3f7d3a;
    --accent-soft: #eef5ec;
    --black: #000;
    --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Display', 'Inter', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'SF Mono', ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body { height: 100%; background: var(--black); }
  body { font-family: var(--sans); color: var(--ink); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: optimizeLegibility; }

  #deck { display: flex; height: 100dvh; overflow-x: auto; overflow-y: hidden; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; scrollbar-width: none; }
  #deck::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

  .slide {
    flex: 0 0 100vw; height: 100dvh; scroll-snap-align: start; overflow-y: auto;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 7vh, 5rem) max(clamp(1.5rem, 7vw, 6rem), calc((100vw - 76rem) / 2)) 6rem;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
    gap: clamp(1.25rem, 3.5vh, 2.5rem);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  .slide > * { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); transition: opacity .6s ease, transform .6s cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .2, 1); }
  .slide.active > * { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .slide.active > *:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: .06s; }
  .slide.active > *:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: .12s; }
  .slide.active > *:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: .18s; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .slide > * { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; } }

  .kicker { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 8rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.045em; line-height: .98; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.6vw, 3.75rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 1.05; max-width: 24ch; text-wrap: balance; }
  h2 .dim { color: var(--faint); }
  h3 { font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.3; }
  p, li, dd { font-size: clamp(.95rem, 1.25vw, 1.0625rem); line-height: 1.55; color: var(--mute); }
  .lede { font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.3rem); max-width: 48rem; color: var(--mute); }
  .note { font-size: clamp(.95rem, 1.3vw, 1.1rem); color: var(--mute); max-width: 52rem; }
  .mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .03em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--faint); }

  /* hero */
  .dark { background: var(--black); color: #f5f5f7; }
  .hero { justify-content: center; }
  .hero h1 { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #a1a1a6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
  .hero .kicker { color: #8fd18a; }
  .lede, .note, .hero-sub, p { text-wrap: pretty; }
  .hero-sub { font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.2vw, 1.75rem); line-height: 1.4; color: #a1a1a6; max-width: 40rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .hero-sub.dimmer { color: #6e6e73; }
  .byline { font-size: .95rem; color: #6e6e73; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .byline a { color: #a1a1a6; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #3a3a3c; }
  .byline a:hover { color: #fff; }

  /* grids */
  .grid { display: grid; gap: clamp(.75rem, 1.4vw, 1.25rem); }
  .g2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .g3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .g4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  .tile { background: var(--tile); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.75rem); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .6rem; }
  .tile .num { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .75rem; color: var(--faint); }
  .tile .test { margin-top: auto; padding-top: .75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

  .stat { padding: .25rem 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; }
  .stat b { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 4rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1; color: var(--ink); }
  .stat p { max-width: 22rem; }

  /* compare */
  .panel { border-radius: 24px; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2.25rem); background: #f2f2f5; }
  .panel.on { background: var(--black); }
  .panel .label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; color: var(--faint); }
  .panel.on .label { color: #8fd18a; }
  .panel ul { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: .85rem; }
  .panel li { font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem); color: var(--faint); text-decoration: line-through; text-decoration-color: #c7c7cc; }
  .panel.on li { color: #f5f5f7; text-decoration: none; }

  /* flow */
  .flow { list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .flow li { padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; position: relative; }
  .flow li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -5px; left: 0; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); }
  .flow .mono { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; font-size: .8rem; }

  /* how it works */
  .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
  .split h2 { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .steps { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .steps > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 6.5rem 1fr; gap: 1rem; padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .steps dt { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .phone { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 28px; padding: 1.25rem; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, .18), 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, .04); max-width: 24rem; justify-self: center; width: 100%; }
  .chat-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .chat-head .dot { width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); }
  .bubble { background: #f2f2f5; border-radius: 18px; padding: 1rem; display: grid; gap: .65rem; }
  .bubble p { font-size: .9rem; color: #3a3a3c; }
  .bubble .b-title { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); font-size: .95rem; }
  .evidence { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .35rem; }
  .evidence span { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .68rem; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; padding: .2rem .55rem; color: var(--mute); }
  .actions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .5rem; margin-top: .25rem; }
  .actions button { font: inherit; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600; border: 0; border-radius: 12px; padding: .6rem; background: #fff; color: var(--ink); }
  .actions .yes { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  .caption { font-size: .72rem; text-align: center; margin-top: .75rem; color: var(--faint); }

  /* habits */
  .habit { display: flex; gap: .9rem; align-items: flex-start; padding: 1.25rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .habit p { font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem); }
  .habit b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .check { flex: 0 0 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent-soft); position: relative; margin-top: .15rem; }
  .check::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 7px; top: 4px; width: 5px; height: 10px; border: solid var(--accent); border-width: 0 2px 2px 0; transform: rotate(45deg); }

  /* timeline */
  .timeline { list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); }
  .timeline li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 2px solid var(--line); }
  .timeline li:first-child { border-top-color: var(--accent); }

  /* chrome */
  #progress { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; z-index: 20; }
  #progress span { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--accent); transform-origin: left; transform: scaleX(0); transition: transform .4s ease; }
  #hud { position: fixed; bottom: 1.25rem; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .25rem; padding: .3rem; border-radius: 999px; z-index: 20;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .72); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, .06); backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px); color: var(--ink); transition: background .3s, color .3s, border-color .3s; }
  #hud.on-dark { background: rgba(40, 40, 42, .72); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .08); color: #f5f5f7; }
